The '''United Midlands''', officially the '''Republic of the United Midlands''', is a [[w:federal state|federal]] [[w:parliamentary republic|parliamentary republic]] in north-central [[Lurandia]]. Its name derives from the historical United Midlands region, a colonial possession of the [[Kingdom of Merica]]. It borders [[Etawa]], [[Kawalidipa]], [[Louyang]], [[Nawat]] and [[Winnipi]].

